1
00:01:02,772 --> 00:01:07,401
Everyone told me
that dreams are a waste

2
00:01:10,196 --> 00:01:15,159
But I can feel it
this time it's gonna be okay

3
00:01:17,077 --> 00:01:22,875
I know good things
will come my way someday

4
00:01:25,419 --> 00:01:32,259
Just a little more push
and tonight I'll take flight

5
00:01:32,676 --> 00:01:37,848
It's gonna be a great day
Everything's gonna go right

6
00:01:37,973 --> 00:01:40,434
We're the stars of this life

7
00:01:40,559 --> 00:01:45,439
No matter how tough the race
we'll finish in first place

8
00:01:45,564 --> 00:01:48,734
Let's make the best days of our lives

9
00:01:48,859 --> 00:01:53,113
Nothing can break us
once we know where our hearts belong

10
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:55,616
We'll see a whole new view

11
00:01:55,741 --> 00:02:00,454
Even if we trip up again
we won't get mad

12
00:02:00,621 --> 00:02:04,917
'Cause we know
we're flying high

13
00:03:34,798 --> 00:03:38,802
And now, let me show you
the crown jewel of our exhibition,

14
00:03:38,928 --> 00:03:42,723
the Astral Compass,
said to hold infinite power.

15
00:03:42,890 --> 00:03:46,477
The last one to use it
was the War God, Phoenix Master,

16
00:03:46,602 --> 00:03:48,646
who then vanished without a trace.

17
00:03:49,063 --> 00:03:53,108
Ever since, even though it's
the greatest treasure in the cosmos,

18
00:03:53,233 --> 00:03:56,362
its magic has never come back.

19
00:03:59,406 --> 00:04:04,870
How to activate the compass
is still a mystery to this day.

20
00:05:45,304 --> 00:05:46,847
No way!

21
00:05:46,972 --> 00:05:49,600
The Astral Compass
just gave off a signal!

22
00:05:49,725 --> 00:05:51,935
It's in Gold City?

23
00:05:52,352 --> 00:05:54,646
Ratallion, move out!

24
00:06:00,319 --> 00:06:02,613
Once that compass is ours,

25
00:06:02,738 --> 00:06:08,035
the Age of the Rats
will finally be here!

26
00:06:20,923 --> 00:06:24,551
If gold and silver
won't do the trick...

27
00:06:24,718 --> 00:06:28,138
He doesn't eat mortal food,
so why not make it out of dough?

28
00:06:28,430 --> 00:06:31,391
My beak's totally wrecked.

29
00:06:35,354 --> 00:06:38,732
This looks even better
than the real compass!

30
00:06:38,857 --> 00:06:41,025
This'll fool the Celestial Master
for sure.

31
00:06:43,028 --> 00:06:44,905
No zapping this time?

32
00:06:45,072 --> 00:06:48,658
Of course not!
Now we can finally go home!

33
00:06:57,334 --> 00:06:59,419
We've only got one shot.
Let's go!

34
00:07:00,462 --> 00:07:02,548
It's do or die!

35
00:07:15,936 --> 00:07:18,605
Celestial Master,
it's been a long time.

36
00:07:25,529 --> 00:07:30,284
Bottle Master, you drank
the elixir and got banished.

37
00:07:30,450 --> 00:07:33,120
I'm Phoenix Master.

38
00:07:33,662 --> 00:07:35,205
Oh, right.

39
00:07:35,330 --> 00:07:38,458
You drank the elixir
and got banished.

40
00:07:38,625 --> 00:07:41,128
That wasn't me either.

41
00:07:41,336 --> 00:07:43,630
Oh, right. Phoenix Master.

42
00:07:44,256 --> 00:07:48,886
You abused your divine powers,
put the people in danger,

43
00:07:49,011 --> 00:07:51,471
and lost the Astral Compass.

44
00:07:51,847 --> 00:07:55,475
Only when you find the compass
and reach enlightenment

45
00:07:55,642 --> 00:07:57,644
can you return to Heaven.

46
00:07:57,769 --> 00:08:01,481
I gave you 300 years,

47
00:08:01,648 --> 00:08:03,650
and your time's almost up.

48
00:08:03,775 --> 00:08:08,280
If you don't get it back,
you'll become a mortal.

49
00:08:08,864 --> 00:08:10,240
Must be nice.

50
00:08:10,365 --> 00:08:12,826
Well, the compass is right here.

51
00:08:19,666 --> 00:08:20,959
Master?

52
00:08:21,668 --> 00:08:22,669
I think we're busted.

53
00:08:22,794 --> 00:08:25,505
No way. My work was flawless.

54
00:08:48,111 --> 00:08:49,321
It's butterscotch!

55
00:08:49,905 --> 00:08:51,865
Please, take a closer look.

56
00:08:54,243 --> 00:08:56,203
What a pathetic fake.

57
00:08:56,370 --> 00:09:01,041
Anyone who tries to fool me
gets punished with lightning!

58
00:09:06,213 --> 00:09:10,384
This is your last chance.
You have until midnight.

59
00:09:11,134 --> 00:09:12,552
Now get going!

60
00:09:14,596 --> 00:09:16,223
And take your scroll with you.

61
00:09:17,182 --> 00:09:20,185
Good thing there was no zapping.

62
00:09:24,231 --> 00:09:27,067
Well, it was only once.

63
00:09:29,152 --> 00:09:31,071
Guess that didn't work.

64
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:35,575
No matter what, we're finding
that compass by midnight!

65
00:09:44,334 --> 00:09:46,086
Whoa, a giant kite!

66
00:09:47,713 --> 00:09:48,922
Where are the gargoyles?

67
00:09:49,089 --> 00:09:53,093
They just sit on the roof.
We can't count on them.

68
00:09:56,805 --> 00:09:57,723
Freeze!

69
00:09:57,848 --> 00:10:00,559
No, don't! You'll make it mad!

70
00:10:02,436 --> 00:10:03,644
Prepare yourself!

71
00:10:11,028 --> 00:10:13,780
Foolish dragon!
You're up against Xander!

72
00:10:13,947 --> 00:10:15,323
Lightning Beam!

73
00:10:19,244 --> 00:10:23,123
A bunch of bumbling gargoyles
are no match for me!

74
00:10:25,959 --> 00:10:26,585
Stop!

75
00:10:26,710 --> 00:10:29,796
I hate fighting.
Let's keep the peace!

76
00:10:31,131 --> 00:10:33,841
Let's not fight.
Let's be friends!

77
00:10:39,723 --> 00:10:40,974
My butt's on fire!

78
00:10:41,183 --> 00:10:42,809
Are you two hurt?

79
00:10:42,976 --> 00:10:45,145
Master, let's take cover!

80
00:10:51,860 --> 00:10:53,987
The compass is close.

81
00:10:54,237 --> 00:10:57,491
Hand it over,
or I'll burn this city down!

82
00:11:15,092 --> 00:11:16,635
We've gotta do something!

83
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:19,179
Unless a hero from Heaven
shows up...

84
00:11:19,346 --> 00:11:20,680
I'll go get one!

85
00:11:20,889 --> 00:11:21,848
When did you get here?

86
00:11:22,057 --> 00:11:25,018
Do you even know
where Heaven is?

87
00:11:25,185 --> 00:11:27,020
This way?

88
00:11:52,629 --> 00:11:54,548
Wow, that was fast.

89
00:12:01,638 --> 00:12:04,391
The compass is mine!

90
00:12:07,394 --> 00:12:08,728
What?

91
00:12:08,895 --> 00:12:11,773
That's my compass!

92
00:13:20,550 --> 00:13:21,968
Too bright!

93
00:13:23,345 --> 00:13:26,598
Ratallion,
bring me that compass!

94
00:13:31,811 --> 00:13:34,856
The hero from Heaven
is a cat?

95
00:13:34,981 --> 00:13:37,150
So that's what a hero looks like?

96
00:13:37,609 --> 00:13:39,819
Look! A kitty!

97
00:13:42,030 --> 00:13:43,323
He beat the demon!

98
00:13:43,490 --> 00:13:44,616
He beat the dragon!

99
00:13:44,741 --> 00:13:45,492
Yeah!

100
00:13:45,617 --> 00:13:47,160
Is he a god?

101
00:13:51,456 --> 00:13:52,332
Action!

102
00:14:12,185 --> 00:14:13,895
He fell from the sky!

103
00:14:14,020 --> 00:14:15,272
He's a god!

104
00:14:15,397 --> 00:14:16,690
A Cat God!

105
00:14:20,193 --> 00:14:23,363
All hail the Cat God!
Protector of Gold City!

106
00:14:31,538 --> 00:14:32,831
We're saved!

107
00:14:32,956 --> 00:14:35,208
M-M-Master...

108
00:14:36,042 --> 00:14:37,711
We love you, Cat God!

109
00:14:38,461 --> 00:14:40,005
Welcome, welcome!

110
00:14:40,130 --> 00:14:43,216
Welcome to the mortal world.
We're so glad you're here.

111
00:14:43,383 --> 00:14:44,884
Now we can't lose!

112
00:14:45,552 --> 00:14:48,847
He must've come
to bring the compass back!

113
00:14:48,972 --> 00:14:51,141
Looks like there's still hope.

114
00:14:51,266 --> 00:14:55,061
The hero beat the demon
and brought us the compass!

115
00:14:55,186 --> 00:14:58,356
Now we can finally go home!

116
00:15:00,859 --> 00:15:01,901
An egg?

117
00:15:03,903 --> 00:15:07,741
These days, whenever I get excited,
I lay eggs...

118
00:15:07,907 --> 00:15:10,577
That'll stop once you're
a phoenix again.

119
00:15:32,807 --> 00:15:36,436
Tom, these guys
are worshipping us!

120
00:15:36,603 --> 00:15:41,941
Before they figure us out,
ditch the guard badge and cap!

121
00:15:45,987 --> 00:15:49,616
Or Jerry's gonna
steal all the credit!

122
00:16:13,181 --> 00:16:15,975
Is this some kind of crown?

123
00:16:17,018 --> 00:16:18,186
Weird.

124
00:16:33,159 --> 00:16:37,497
Since I was banished...
I mean, transferred 300 years ago,

125
00:16:37,622 --> 00:16:41,668
I bet Heaven's
changed quite a bit.

126
00:16:41,918 --> 00:16:45,004
So what's trending
up there these days?

127
00:16:45,338 --> 00:16:49,634
Why isn't he saying anything?
Is he testing us?

128
00:16:54,514 --> 00:16:56,558
This stick's all prickly.

129
00:16:57,058 --> 00:17:00,854
Sonny, hey!
Give that back to our guest.

130
00:17:01,020 --> 00:17:03,022
It's not meant for us.

131
00:17:06,359 --> 00:17:10,071
I'm Phoenix Master,
leader of the gargoyles.

132
00:17:12,198 --> 00:17:17,162
I'm honored you came
all the way from Heaven.

133
00:17:21,833 --> 00:17:24,377
Master, are you okay?

134
00:17:37,557 --> 00:17:39,225
This is my partner,

135
00:17:39,392 --> 00:17:41,519
a phoenix that looks like a giant chicken.

136
00:17:42,103 --> 00:17:46,399
How about hopping on
for a tour of Gold City?

137
00:17:46,524 --> 00:17:49,736
When we get back,
we'll throw you a welcome party.

138
00:17:52,572 --> 00:17:54,574
No outside food on this flight.

139
00:17:57,535 --> 00:18:01,664
You guys, get ready
for the welcome party.

140
00:18:01,790 --> 00:18:02,582
Got it!

141
00:18:02,749 --> 00:18:04,375
Party time!

142
00:18:11,132 --> 00:18:13,218
Today's the Lantern Festival.

143
00:18:13,343 --> 00:18:17,263
And with you here,
it's gonna be even better.

144
00:18:20,809 --> 00:18:24,062
That's the Golden Temple,
where I'm stationed.

145
00:18:25,688 --> 00:18:28,066
You can see the whole city from there.

146
00:18:28,191 --> 00:18:31,236
If anything happens,
we're there in a flash.

147
00:18:32,529 --> 00:18:33,947
That's Golden Lake.

148
00:18:34,072 --> 00:18:37,700
In spring, people come from all over
to see the flowers.

149
00:18:37,826 --> 00:18:39,619
Pretty, right?

150
00:18:45,834 --> 00:18:47,293
That's the gate.

151
00:18:48,795 --> 00:18:51,965
And this moat is
the biggest in the kingdom.

152
00:18:53,758 --> 00:18:58,304
We built all of it
in less than 100 years.

153
00:19:00,807 --> 00:19:03,351
This is Lantern Street,

154
00:19:03,476 --> 00:19:06,479
the liveliest street in town.

155
00:19:07,105 --> 00:19:09,315
Hold on tight!

156
00:19:17,448 --> 00:19:18,658
Why, you little...

157
00:19:22,203 --> 00:19:23,204
The compass!

158
00:19:30,211 --> 00:19:31,170
The kitty!

159
00:19:39,470 --> 00:19:41,347
Slow down!

160
00:19:45,101 --> 00:19:45,852
Cat God!

161
00:19:53,943 --> 00:19:55,695
It's Master's float!

162
00:20:03,036 --> 00:20:05,371
And who's this dashing fellow?

163
00:20:05,538 --> 00:20:08,166
Why, it's me!

164
00:20:08,291 --> 00:20:10,543
Master's float this year is...

165
00:20:10,710 --> 00:20:11,878
What's wrong?

166
00:20:12,003 --> 00:20:12,879
It doesn't look like you.

167
00:20:13,046 --> 00:20:14,839
Nonsense, it's a perfect match.

168
00:20:15,882 --> 00:20:18,217
It's the spitting image of me, right?

169
00:21:11,854 --> 00:21:13,272
Amazing!

170
00:21:16,192 --> 00:21:17,402
Best ever!

171
00:21:41,968 --> 00:21:45,138
So you're the new god in town.

172
00:21:56,107 --> 00:21:57,025
Look at that!

173
00:22:00,945 --> 00:22:02,155
Cat God!

174
00:22:02,363 --> 00:22:04,824
Where is he? Cat God!

175
00:22:07,994 --> 00:22:10,163
She's in the middle of a performance.

176
00:22:15,668 --> 00:22:17,837
This is my pupil, Jade.

177
00:22:18,004 --> 00:22:20,673
So you like Peking opera?

178
00:22:20,798 --> 00:22:24,802
In that case,
why not dance with me?

179
00:22:26,512 --> 00:22:27,930
Leave it to me!

180
00:22:28,056 --> 00:22:29,182
Stay here.

181
00:22:30,349 --> 00:22:33,644
Out in the sun,
our odds of winning are slim.

182
00:22:54,874 --> 00:22:57,210
What's that fur ball?

183
00:23:02,507 --> 00:23:03,382
This is awesome!

184
00:23:11,099 --> 00:23:13,726
What opera is this?

185
00:23:30,576 --> 00:23:32,286
That's a cheap shot!

186
00:23:45,091 --> 00:23:46,926
Hot! I'm burning!

187
00:23:51,472 --> 00:23:53,266
Leave it to us!

188
00:23:53,724 --> 00:23:54,767
Look out!

189
00:24:05,319 --> 00:24:09,115
It's not safe here.
I'll protect the compass.

190
00:24:10,533 --> 00:24:11,784
Get 'em!

191
00:24:12,618 --> 00:24:13,828
Behind you!

192
00:24:47,570 --> 00:24:48,321
Take that!

193
00:25:13,846 --> 00:25:16,349
Bravo! Amazing!

194
00:25:16,933 --> 00:25:19,727
I get it! It's avant-garde!

195
00:25:20,478 --> 00:25:22,980
A Bunny vs. Duck Peking opera!

196
00:25:23,522 --> 00:25:24,482
Oh, I see.

197
00:25:26,525 --> 00:25:31,030
Everyone, thank you
for the warm applause!

198
00:25:48,256 --> 00:25:50,341
Someone's after me.

199
00:25:51,050 --> 00:25:52,385
No, they're after the compass.

200
00:25:56,889 --> 00:26:00,226
It's already 3:00.
We need to hurry.

201
00:26:02,436 --> 00:26:04,230
Sorry I wasn't a better host.

202
00:26:04,397 --> 00:26:08,401
The festival and your
welcome party start soon.

203
00:26:21,497 --> 00:26:23,749
Peach buns! Get your peach buns!

204
00:26:23,916 --> 00:26:25,042
It's the Cat God!

205
00:26:25,167 --> 00:26:27,086
I'm the Cat God!

206
00:26:28,254 --> 00:26:30,047
Cat God paper cuttings!

207
00:26:30,172 --> 00:26:33,009
Cat God candy sculptures!

208
00:26:33,134 --> 00:26:36,929
Cat God pictures!
They keep demons away!

209
00:26:37,096 --> 00:26:38,431
Peach buns here!

210
00:26:47,940 --> 00:26:51,610
All hail the Cat God!
He beat the evil rat!

211
00:26:51,944 --> 00:26:55,781
All hail the Cat God!
He beat the evil rat!

212
00:27:25,644 --> 00:27:30,191
We've gathered the city's
finest dishes just for you.

213
00:27:30,316 --> 00:27:31,650
Enjoy!

214
00:27:49,085 --> 00:27:52,004
Yo, yo, everybody, eyes on me

215
00:27:52,671 --> 00:27:56,300
Gonna be a legend
Mic in hand, racing down the highway

216
00:27:56,717 --> 00:28:00,346
Brains and hustle, we get paid
Gonna win, call up the crew

217
00:28:00,513 --> 00:28:01,347
Tom and Jerry

218
00:28:01,514 --> 00:28:05,393
Make some noise, let it out
We're all anybody talks about

219
00:28:05,518 --> 00:28:09,688
Coolest cat and the slickest mouse
The whole world's hooked

220
00:28:09,814 --> 00:28:13,692
Ride the rhythm
Rhymes overflowing

221
00:28:13,859 --> 00:28:17,696
DJ on a plane
T and J out the window

222
00:28:17,822 --> 00:28:21,492
My head is spinning
Let's shout it on the dance floor

223
00:28:21,617 --> 00:28:25,246
Nothing but cool cats here
Sunshine pouring down

224
00:28:25,371 --> 00:28:28,874
The cat next to me is cool
Rising like a phoenix

225
00:28:28,999 --> 00:28:33,003
Brand-new family
Hurry up, it's a party

226
00:28:33,462 --> 00:28:37,216
My buddy's got a new chain
Saving the city again

227
00:28:37,341 --> 00:28:41,303
Bring the crew wherever we go
Cat with a compass, bring it on

228
00:28:41,429 --> 00:28:44,723
Tom and Jerry
Gonna grab this sky

229
00:28:44,974 --> 00:28:49,145
Sun in our hearts, gather round
World is ours, feeling good

230
00:28:49,270 --> 00:28:51,730
Nothing can stop our ride

231
00:28:51,856 --> 00:28:53,732
Hop in that brand-new limo

232
00:28:53,899 --> 00:28:55,860
Fireworks go boom, it's our time

233
00:28:55,985 --> 00:28:58,696
Everybody in Gold City,
let's go!

234
00:29:05,786 --> 00:29:07,538
Look who's full of himself.

235
00:29:11,917 --> 00:29:14,920
You're gonna give me wrinkles!

236
00:29:15,087 --> 00:29:17,089
Careful!

237
00:29:17,548 --> 00:29:19,758
I have sensitive skin!

238
00:29:22,261 --> 00:29:24,972
This is my special
Heavenly Peach wine.

239
00:29:25,306 --> 00:29:26,765
Please, have a taste.

240
00:29:28,767 --> 00:29:32,396
It's a legendary peach that only
ripens once every 3,000 years.

241
00:29:32,521 --> 00:29:34,607
One sip and you'll feel reborn.

242
00:29:35,524 --> 00:29:37,276
All your worries will vanish.

243
00:29:40,279 --> 00:29:44,033
If you had wine that good,
why didn't I get any?

244
00:29:44,158 --> 00:29:48,412
It's just peach wine
with some strong catnip in it.

245
00:29:48,537 --> 00:29:51,123
Once he's drunk,
we'll swipe the compass.

246
00:29:52,374 --> 00:29:53,834
Bottoms up!

247
00:30:25,407 --> 00:30:28,118
Got a snack to go with your drink?

248
00:31:09,785 --> 00:31:12,705
Here, have another.

249
00:31:13,038 --> 00:31:15,165
Smells great, but I'll pass.

250
00:31:58,250 --> 00:32:00,085
Playtime's over!

251
00:32:00,252 --> 00:32:02,504
Here comes the great Mega-Rat!

252
00:32:17,519 --> 00:32:20,814
You guys need to be taught a lesson!

253
00:32:28,614 --> 00:32:30,449
Learned your lesson?

254
00:32:32,284 --> 00:32:34,286
As for you...

255
00:32:39,375 --> 00:32:40,793
You're starving, huh?

256
00:32:41,126 --> 00:32:44,797
I baked some treats earlier.
Go on, eat.

257
00:32:49,218 --> 00:32:52,638
It breaks my heart
to see someone get bullied.

258
00:32:54,556 --> 00:32:57,184
From now on, I've got your back.

259
00:32:58,769 --> 00:32:59,812
Come on.

260
00:33:00,938 --> 00:33:02,189
Let's go home.

261
00:33:07,194 --> 00:33:10,614
To fly high,
you've gotta ride the wind.

262
00:33:11,156 --> 00:33:15,327
Catch the wind
and soar up into the sky!

263
00:33:37,349 --> 00:33:39,643
You're one of us now.

264
00:33:40,436 --> 00:33:42,521
I want to show you something.

265
00:33:48,152 --> 00:33:51,822
These treasures took me
years to collect.

266
00:33:52,197 --> 00:33:53,907
You've got a good eye.

267
00:33:54,575 --> 00:33:56,201
Just like I thought.

268
00:33:56,326 --> 00:33:59,830
Fate brought us together.

269
00:34:05,753 --> 00:34:08,964
Everything here is
proof of ancient glory.

270
00:34:09,089 --> 00:34:11,675
But now it's all just useless junk.

271
00:34:11,800 --> 00:34:17,389
Only those bold enough to take risks
make their mark on history.

272
00:34:23,729 --> 00:34:27,399
What does Gold City
need more than anything?

273
00:34:28,734 --> 00:34:29,902
You.

274
00:34:30,068 --> 00:34:33,238
You, and that
brilliant brain of yours.

275
00:34:34,948 --> 00:34:38,994
Sadly, the ones fate
loves to toy with...

276
00:34:39,536 --> 00:34:42,414
are always the smart ones.

277
00:34:43,791 --> 00:34:48,420
Fate always finds a way
to hit us where it hurts.

278
00:34:54,551 --> 00:34:58,430
I used to have a dream
just like you.

279
00:34:58,680 --> 00:35:02,935
Until that day, 300 years ago...

280
00:35:06,814 --> 00:35:08,774
Too slow! Catch me if you can!

281
00:35:10,192 --> 00:35:13,237
Over here, lizard boy!
I'm right here!

282
00:35:14,696 --> 00:35:17,783
Feel the power of the compass!

283
00:35:33,674 --> 00:35:34,967
Help!

284
00:35:39,137 --> 00:35:41,098
My eyes hurt!

285
00:35:47,980 --> 00:35:49,273
My tail...

286
00:35:49,940 --> 00:35:52,651
No... My tail!

287
00:35:54,111 --> 00:35:58,282
Ever since that day,
I can't stand the sunlight.

288
00:35:58,407 --> 00:36:01,869
I was forced underground
to plot my plans.

289
00:36:03,078 --> 00:36:06,456
But then I found this.

290
00:36:07,249 --> 00:36:09,251
A gift from fate.

291
00:36:09,376 --> 00:36:15,173
Heaven's power only shows
its true strength in hands like ours.

292
00:36:15,716 --> 00:36:19,177
We were one step away
from making our dream come true,

293
00:36:19,303 --> 00:36:24,182
but that cat got the compass
and turned himself into a fake god.

294
00:36:24,516 --> 00:36:26,018
You're the one who found it.

295
00:36:26,602 --> 00:36:31,690
However you slice it,
you deserve that compass.

296
00:36:35,319 --> 00:36:38,947
They've always
looked down on us

297
00:36:39,197 --> 00:36:42,868
Soon they'll see
what we can really do

298
00:36:43,035 --> 00:36:46,413
The time has come
Heaven's rules don't apply

299
00:36:46,538 --> 00:36:49,499
It's meant to be mine

300
00:36:49,625 --> 00:36:52,711
I want that compass

301
00:36:52,878 --> 00:36:56,548
No one's ever gonna
make a fool of me again

302
00:36:56,715 --> 00:37:00,677
We'll never bow to the gargoyles

303
00:37:00,969 --> 00:37:03,555
We'll get the ultimate weapon

304
00:37:05,515 --> 00:37:09,353
We'll stage a dazzling revolt

305
00:37:09,478 --> 00:37:13,231
Mega-Rat and the Ratallion

306
00:37:13,565 --> 00:37:17,569
will rewrite history now!

307
00:37:29,748 --> 00:37:34,086
He's gonna love
our little gift.

308
00:37:38,715 --> 00:37:40,759
To our friendship!

309
00:37:48,850 --> 00:37:52,604
When you hear the drums,
the festival's begun!

310
00:37:55,440 --> 00:37:56,566
Wow.

311
00:37:57,609 --> 00:37:59,111
So pretty!

312
00:38:24,094 --> 00:38:25,804
Hang in there.

313
00:38:26,138 --> 00:38:28,306
The fun's just getting started.

314
00:38:35,355 --> 00:38:36,440
Master!

315
00:38:36,815 --> 00:38:38,358
Your seats are ready.

316
00:38:38,567 --> 00:38:40,527
You're in for a real treat.

317
00:38:40,652 --> 00:38:42,154
Let's get started.

318
00:38:44,072 --> 00:38:47,492
Please watch your step.

319
00:39:05,886 --> 00:39:09,181
Master, there's light
coming from beyond the wall.

320
00:39:11,433 --> 00:39:13,852
You couldn't wait a few more seconds?

321
00:39:36,208 --> 00:39:38,752
What's that float?

322
00:39:40,545 --> 00:39:42,547
Uh-oh, it's not approved!

323
00:39:43,215 --> 00:39:44,883
Are the gates shut?

324
00:39:45,050 --> 00:39:45,717
Yes.

325
00:39:45,842 --> 00:39:47,052
Look!

326
00:40:30,262 --> 00:40:32,097
It's the Cat God's float!

327
00:40:39,271 --> 00:40:40,021
Huge!

328
00:40:40,147 --> 00:40:41,273
Amazing!

329
00:40:42,232 --> 00:40:43,400
A gift from Heaven!

330
00:40:43,525 --> 00:40:45,902
I've never seen
such a big float!

331
00:40:55,912 --> 00:40:57,164
Incredible.

332
00:40:57,289 --> 00:40:59,249
That's the Cat God for you!

333
00:41:08,049 --> 00:41:09,134
What's that?

334
00:41:09,259 --> 00:41:10,969
Looks like shadow puppets.

335
00:41:28,069 --> 00:41:32,324
You fraud!
The compass is mine!

336
00:41:35,285 --> 00:41:39,289
Ratallion,
hoist him up!

337
00:41:39,789 --> 00:41:43,210
Let the little guy
get his revenge!

338
00:41:57,933 --> 00:41:59,142
You broke it!

339
00:41:59,267 --> 00:42:01,645
Go see what's going on.

340
00:42:01,770 --> 00:42:02,520
Yes, sir!

341
00:42:15,325 --> 00:42:19,204
Let me show you
my real gift!

342
00:42:26,378 --> 00:42:29,047
Don't get in my way!
What about your revenge?

343
00:42:43,645 --> 00:42:45,855
Tie him up!

344
00:42:45,981 --> 00:42:46,856
Got it.

345
00:42:46,982 --> 00:42:48,233
Fly!

346
00:42:58,702 --> 00:42:59,577
It's hopeless!

347
00:42:59,744 --> 00:43:01,121
Protect the city!

348
00:43:09,212 --> 00:43:10,422
He's alive!

349
00:43:10,588 --> 00:43:11,715
He's okay!

350
00:43:13,049 --> 00:43:13,883
Who tied you up?

351
00:43:14,009 --> 00:43:15,719
How'd you survive that?

352
00:43:24,060 --> 00:43:25,770
My precious float...

353
00:43:28,148 --> 00:43:32,610
You ruined the festival
and hurt our people!

354
00:43:34,279 --> 00:43:35,363
Wait a sec.

355
00:43:35,739 --> 00:43:38,575
Where'd you put the compass?

356
00:43:41,578 --> 00:43:42,287
This is the worst!

357
00:43:42,620 --> 00:43:44,289
Aren't you on our side?

358
00:43:45,373 --> 00:43:47,042
How did this happen?

359
00:43:49,586 --> 00:43:51,463
Because he's not a real god.

360
00:43:52,255 --> 00:43:54,966
Heavenly objects never break.

361
00:43:58,636 --> 00:44:01,473
Master,
we found footprints!

362
00:44:02,891 --> 00:44:04,476
I smell a rat.

363
00:44:05,226 --> 00:44:06,978
There's a weird machine here!

364
00:44:21,993 --> 00:44:23,161
So that's what it was!

365
00:44:23,286 --> 00:44:26,664
That monster rat
stole the compass!

366
00:44:26,790 --> 00:44:29,334
Why steal a cat's stuff?

367
00:44:29,542 --> 00:44:33,671
That compass is a powerful tool
given to us by Heaven.

368
00:44:33,838 --> 00:44:37,008
If it falls into the wrong hands,
we're all in danger.

369
00:44:38,927 --> 00:44:40,845
You two, protect the city.

370
00:44:41,429 --> 00:44:42,180
Yes, sir!

371
00:44:56,361 --> 00:45:00,698
I don't care if you're a god or not.
But liars are the worst.

372
00:45:19,300 --> 00:45:21,553
Big mistake, mousey.

373
00:45:27,350 --> 00:45:31,396
We could've changed
history together.

374
00:45:38,570 --> 00:45:40,071
Scared?

375
00:45:41,781 --> 00:45:44,409
Feeling the heat?

376
00:45:46,536 --> 00:45:50,957
Too late for regrets.
Begging won't save you.

377
00:45:52,750 --> 00:45:56,379
Behold! The heart of Gold City,

378
00:45:56,713 --> 00:45:59,257
Ao Jiao Palace!

379
00:46:15,482 --> 00:46:17,984
Astral Compass, open!

380
00:46:23,865 --> 00:46:26,284
What's going on?

381
00:46:28,286 --> 00:46:30,205
Why won't it open?

382
00:46:30,330 --> 00:46:34,667
You used it to take down
my Mecha Dragon!

383
00:46:34,959 --> 00:46:38,129
Tell me the secret! Now!

384
00:46:51,684 --> 00:46:53,811
Yes, that's it!

385
00:46:54,729 --> 00:46:56,814
More power!

386
00:47:00,818 --> 00:47:02,654
Don't stop!

387
00:47:09,410 --> 00:47:12,163
The day has finally come!

388
00:47:12,997 --> 00:47:16,125
The great Mega-Rat...

389
00:47:16,251 --> 00:47:18,670
will conquer the world!

390
00:47:36,062 --> 00:47:37,313
It's him!

391
00:47:44,529 --> 00:47:47,198
Our festival's totally ruined.

392
00:47:47,365 --> 00:47:50,076
There's no way we can beat that.

393
00:47:50,201 --> 00:47:51,536
Who even are they?

394
00:47:51,703 --> 00:47:52,829
They might come back.

395
00:47:52,954 --> 00:47:54,872
We need a real hero.

396
00:47:59,919 --> 00:48:01,713
Kitty, over here!

397
00:48:02,463 --> 00:48:05,550
My mouse friend got kidnapped!

398
00:48:15,393 --> 00:48:17,562
Please save him!

399
00:48:18,521 --> 00:48:20,106
You're a hero, right?

400
00:48:24,694 --> 00:48:26,571
You'll help me?

401
00:48:33,494 --> 00:48:35,747
Master's still not back.

402
00:48:36,080 --> 00:48:37,749
He'll be back soon.

403
00:48:37,915 --> 00:48:40,335
He told us to guard the city.

404
00:48:40,460 --> 00:48:43,421
Wow, heartless.
Or are you just scared?

405
00:49:01,314 --> 00:49:03,608
You troublemaker!
What do you want?

406
00:49:03,733 --> 00:49:07,278
Here to cause more trouble?
Get lost!

407
00:49:19,332 --> 00:49:21,959
You're gonna save him
all by yourself?

408
00:49:32,345 --> 00:49:34,138
We should do the right thing.

409
00:49:34,681 --> 00:49:38,601
He's brave enough to save his friend.
What about us?

410
00:49:41,145 --> 00:49:43,481
What do we do?
What about Master's orders?

411
00:49:48,444 --> 00:49:50,154
We've gotta do it!

412
00:50:00,373 --> 00:50:01,708
Need a ride?

413
00:50:03,710 --> 00:50:05,294
You'll never make it on foot.

414
00:50:08,047 --> 00:50:09,173
Hold on!

415
00:50:09,674 --> 00:50:10,550
Let's go!

416
00:50:45,209 --> 00:50:46,210
Over there!

417
00:51:01,809 --> 00:51:03,227
They fell into a trap!

418
00:51:03,394 --> 00:51:04,228
Master!

419
00:51:04,395 --> 00:51:06,773
Is he... gone?

420
00:51:06,898 --> 00:51:08,566
I'm immortal!

421
00:51:08,733 --> 00:51:11,152
I'm only in here
'cause it's cozy.

422
00:51:11,778 --> 00:51:15,239
I told you to guard the city.
Why'd you come?

423
00:51:15,907 --> 00:51:17,575
Jade wanted to come.

424
00:51:17,742 --> 00:51:19,827
Go back and guard the temple.

425
00:51:19,952 --> 00:51:21,245
Yes, sir. Right away.

426
00:51:21,370 --> 00:51:24,540
Wait! Get us out of here first!

427
00:51:24,665 --> 00:51:25,583
Got it.

428
00:51:38,304 --> 00:51:39,555
Caught again.

429
00:51:49,190 --> 00:51:50,441
It's Feeny's fault.

430
00:51:52,026 --> 00:51:53,277
Why's he here?

431
00:51:53,444 --> 00:51:54,946
To save his friend.

432
00:51:55,530 --> 00:51:58,616
A fraud has friends?

433
00:52:05,122 --> 00:52:08,084
It's dangerous here.
Go back, now.

434
00:52:08,209 --> 00:52:09,293
You can't go alone...

435
00:52:09,460 --> 00:52:11,295
You need backup!

436
00:52:11,629 --> 00:52:14,799
We're ready for your orders!

437
00:52:15,883 --> 00:52:18,135
Just stay out of my way.

438
00:52:26,227 --> 00:52:29,480
The enemy just declared war!

439
00:52:31,148 --> 00:52:32,149
Charge!

440
00:52:32,525 --> 00:52:34,485
We're not scared!

441
00:52:41,367 --> 00:52:44,328
Good, keep it up!

442
00:52:44,495 --> 00:52:48,374
Keep pedaling!
Don't you dare stop!

443
00:52:48,541 --> 00:52:50,835
Pedal till you drop!

444
00:52:51,002 --> 00:52:54,922
Push down hard!
Full speed ahead!

445
00:52:56,007 --> 00:53:00,177
Get those hearts pumping!
Harder!

446
00:53:00,678 --> 00:53:02,638
One, two, three, four!

447
00:53:02,763 --> 00:53:04,682
Five, six, seven, eight!

448
00:53:04,849 --> 00:53:09,645
Pedal, pedal, pedal away!
Make me happy!

449
00:53:10,187 --> 00:53:12,857
Boss! Intruders!

450
00:53:13,733 --> 00:53:16,027
The bumbling gargoyles are here?

451
00:53:16,193 --> 00:53:20,197
I've been waiting.
I'll crush them!

452
00:53:20,364 --> 00:53:24,577
Time to show them
the power of Mega-Rat!

453
00:53:32,209 --> 00:53:34,211
Wait, calm down.

454
00:53:34,420 --> 00:53:37,006
Watch out for traps.

455
00:53:37,381 --> 00:53:39,717
Even the smartest guy...

456
00:53:42,511 --> 00:53:44,055
That didn't sound good.

457
00:53:59,654 --> 00:54:04,408
Mega-Rat's reign
has finally come!

458
00:54:04,742 --> 00:54:10,039
Mega-Rat's reign
has finally come!

459
00:54:18,255 --> 00:54:19,924
Night-night.

460
00:54:22,426 --> 00:54:24,428
Don't breathe in the smoke!

461
00:54:25,429 --> 00:54:27,431
Hurry, this way!

462
00:54:48,536 --> 00:54:50,871
Your friend's a bar snack?

463
00:54:57,211 --> 00:54:58,004
Scatter!

464
00:55:05,469 --> 00:55:07,930
It's no good! My powers won't work!

465
00:55:08,055 --> 00:55:10,766
Master, I'm getting
kinda sleepy...

466
00:55:10,891 --> 00:55:13,144
It's that smoke!

467
00:55:28,826 --> 00:55:31,996
Remember me,
Phoenix Master?

468
00:55:32,830 --> 00:55:35,833
Quit the tricks and show yourself!

469
00:55:36,250 --> 00:55:38,461
You haven't changed a bit.

470
00:55:46,886 --> 00:55:48,095
Phoenix Master!

471
00:55:48,220 --> 00:55:53,017
I'm just a rat now,
but someday I'll be a gargoyle

472
00:55:53,184 --> 00:55:55,478
and protect our home with my inventions!

473
00:55:56,020 --> 00:55:57,646
Take a look.

474
00:55:57,772 --> 00:55:59,065
A smoke bomb.

475
00:55:59,565 --> 00:56:02,193
It blows up when
an intruder steps on it.

476
00:56:03,611 --> 00:56:06,280
These are my all-direction
surveillance goggles.

477
00:56:06,405 --> 00:56:08,657
You can see in every direction.

478
00:56:09,742 --> 00:56:12,703
And this gadget
is even cooler...

479
00:56:14,872 --> 00:56:17,374
It's all just kid stuff.

480
00:56:17,374 --> 00:56:18,042
It's all just kid stuff.

481
00:56:18,375 --> 00:56:20,002
"Kid stuff"?

482
00:56:20,503 --> 00:56:24,840
Then see what this "kid stuff"
can do!

483
00:56:25,299 --> 00:56:26,092
The compass!

484
00:56:26,217 --> 00:56:29,386
Let's settle this!

485
00:56:30,679 --> 00:56:31,722
Master!

486
00:56:33,682 --> 00:56:34,725
Master!

487
00:57:00,126 --> 00:57:02,586
Enjoying my magic birdcage?

488
00:57:05,881 --> 00:57:10,928
Once you're caught,
nobody gets out!

489
00:57:12,596 --> 00:57:14,098
My compass!

490
00:57:20,062 --> 00:57:21,480
Get the compass back!

491
00:57:29,446 --> 00:57:30,614
You're not getting away!

492
00:57:36,453 --> 00:57:37,580
Get him!

493
00:57:44,712 --> 00:57:45,921
Over there!

494
00:57:50,426 --> 00:57:51,510
Get him!

495
00:57:58,475 --> 00:58:00,477
Close in from both sides!

496
00:58:03,314 --> 00:58:04,982
There's no escape!

497
00:58:07,318 --> 00:58:08,777
We have to help!

498
00:58:11,739 --> 00:58:12,990
Over there!

499
00:58:28,839 --> 00:58:30,299
Gotcha!

500
00:58:34,678 --> 00:58:37,681
Oh, well.
It's just a compass.

501
00:58:37,806 --> 00:58:40,017
Who cares?

502
00:58:45,814 --> 00:58:47,858
Doesn't matter.

503
00:58:48,484 --> 00:58:50,736
Let's just float away.

504
00:59:03,999 --> 00:59:06,502
What really matters in life is love and...

505
00:59:06,627 --> 00:59:08,087
Huh?

506
00:59:08,587 --> 00:59:10,923
Forget that. Attack!

507
00:59:12,675 --> 00:59:14,051
Feeny, what're you doing?

508
00:59:14,176 --> 00:59:17,054
I laid an egg
and it floated away!

509
00:59:17,429 --> 00:59:20,599
Those are special eggs!
Lay more!

510
00:59:22,434 --> 00:59:26,522
Special eggs?
Does that mean I'm special?

511
00:59:30,609 --> 00:59:32,987
I'm not stressed enough!

512
00:59:33,112 --> 00:59:34,571
It's all on you.

513
00:59:34,738 --> 00:59:38,701
If you don't lay 'em,
we'll all have egg on our faces!

514
00:59:38,826 --> 00:59:40,035
I've gotta do this!

515
00:59:40,160 --> 00:59:41,578
Don't push yourself!

516
00:59:41,704 --> 00:59:43,372
It's fine. I'm ready for anything.

517
00:59:43,497 --> 00:59:45,582
I'm no chicken!

518
00:59:45,749 --> 00:59:49,211
I'm not going down
without laying some eggs!

519
00:59:49,420 --> 00:59:51,088
Take this!

520
00:59:54,717 --> 00:59:56,093
How's that? There's more!

521
00:59:56,218 --> 00:59:57,303
Wow.

522
00:59:58,178 --> 01:00:00,764
I'll lay even more!

523
01:00:12,568 --> 01:00:13,902
Stop!

524
01:00:18,115 --> 01:00:19,575
You traitor!

525
01:00:28,250 --> 01:00:29,293
This is awesome!

526
01:01:04,328 --> 01:01:05,329
The exit's over there!

527
01:01:39,446 --> 01:01:40,656
Hold on!

528
01:02:09,726 --> 01:02:13,063
Xander,
I'm totally fine!

529
01:02:14,982 --> 01:02:16,066
Is that...?

530
01:02:22,239 --> 01:02:23,073
The compass!

531
01:02:33,000 --> 01:02:34,585
I owe you guys one.

532
01:02:37,045 --> 01:02:39,298
Gold City is safe!

533
01:02:39,756 --> 01:02:41,258
Our city is safe!

534
01:02:41,508 --> 01:02:43,594
Peace is back in the city!

535
01:02:47,389 --> 01:02:50,100
I'm gonna miss this place.

536
01:02:50,267 --> 01:02:51,810
Me too.

537
01:02:52,269 --> 01:02:55,230
We worked so hard for this city.

538
01:02:55,355 --> 01:02:57,107
Heaven's finally gonna see your worth!

539
01:02:57,274 --> 01:03:00,611
I couldn't have done it
without your help.

540
01:03:00,777 --> 01:03:03,530
Heaven's gonna reward you!

541
01:03:03,655 --> 01:03:06,992
See? Take a chance,
and you get the reward.

542
01:03:07,618 --> 01:03:09,244
Best teamwork ever!

543
01:03:09,369 --> 01:03:12,956
"Phoenix Master,
the Dragon Slayer and Fallen God,"

544
01:03:13,123 --> 01:03:16,793
"has harmed the people
and lost the compass."

545
01:03:17,127 --> 01:03:21,632
"He shall henceforth
guard Gold City."

546
01:03:21,757 --> 01:03:25,135
"Only when he finds the compass
and reaches enlightenment"

547
01:03:25,302 --> 01:03:28,180
"may he return to Heaven
as a god."

548
01:03:28,305 --> 01:03:32,643
"He has 300 years,
or he'll face eternal exile."

549
01:03:34,311 --> 01:03:38,315
Jade, that's practice
for your next show, right?

550
01:03:38,482 --> 01:03:42,152
What's that opera called?
Who wrote it?

551
01:03:42,486 --> 01:03:44,446
I'm beat. Let's go home.

552
01:03:44,571 --> 01:03:45,656
Master.

553
01:03:46,865 --> 01:03:50,202
You only wanted the compass
so you could go back to Heaven?

554
01:03:51,245 --> 01:03:52,871
You're leaving us behind?

555
01:03:52,996 --> 01:03:55,791
You weren't transferred?
You were banished?

556
01:03:56,041 --> 01:03:59,002
Why didn't you tell us?

557
01:04:03,173 --> 01:04:07,678
300 years flew by.
I never had time to explain.

558
01:04:07,844 --> 01:04:10,847
Besides, I'm originally
from Heaven.

559
01:04:11,223 --> 01:04:12,724
I miss home.

560
01:04:13,058 --> 01:04:15,477
Aren't you coming back?

561
01:04:15,978 --> 01:04:18,689
I'll watch over you
wherever I am.

562
01:04:19,356 --> 01:04:22,359
I'll get the gods
to send you their blessings.

563
01:04:22,526 --> 01:04:24,486
That's what's best for the city.

564
01:04:25,153 --> 01:04:28,365
I thought we were a good team.

565
01:04:28,824 --> 01:04:31,868
Are you happy being
lowly temple guards?

566
01:04:32,202 --> 01:04:35,038
If you don't aim higher,
you're a loser.

567
01:04:35,372 --> 01:04:39,543
You're okay being called
"useless roof-squatters"?

568
01:04:44,881 --> 01:04:48,427
Master's hurting too.
Don't hold it against him.

569
01:04:48,552 --> 01:04:52,889
Sonny, your dad
is Master's best friend.

570
01:04:53,015 --> 01:04:56,226
Master trusts Xander
to protect the city.

571
01:04:56,393 --> 01:05:00,772
And Jade,
you're Master's favorite pupil.

572
01:05:01,315 --> 01:05:02,566
Feeny.

573
01:05:04,067 --> 01:05:05,235
We're out of time.

574
01:05:05,986 --> 01:05:07,070
Let's go.

575
01:05:12,743 --> 01:05:15,245
There are gifts for you
on the temple roof.

576
01:05:44,941 --> 01:05:46,943
By seven stars and full moon's shine,

577
01:05:47,319 --> 01:05:49,404
guide the power of Dipper Divine.

578
01:05:49,738 --> 01:05:51,657
Veil of Heaven, lift!

579
01:06:09,216 --> 01:06:11,760
Feeny, we're finally home!

580
01:06:18,141 --> 01:06:21,645
Celestial Master,
this compass is the real deal!

581
01:06:56,054 --> 01:06:58,014
Master, wake up!

582
01:07:00,851 --> 01:07:04,062
Master, come on, wake up!

583
01:07:11,570 --> 01:07:14,197
Where are we?
Isn't this Heaven?

584
01:07:14,364 --> 01:07:19,870
He said we're "not enlightened yet"
and knocked us back down.

585
01:07:27,669 --> 01:07:29,504
What time is it?

586
01:07:29,629 --> 01:07:30,881
Just past midnight.

587
01:07:31,423 --> 01:07:33,675
No way! Where's the compass?

588
01:07:35,260 --> 01:07:37,721
It must be broken.

589
01:07:38,305 --> 01:07:42,184
There's still time
before midnight, right?

590
01:07:42,350 --> 01:07:43,185
But...

591
01:07:46,938 --> 01:07:51,610
By seven stars and full moon's shine,
guide the power of Dipper Divine.

592
01:07:53,528 --> 01:07:55,697
Veil of Heaven, lift!

593
01:07:58,241 --> 01:08:00,368
Veil of Heaven, lift!

594
01:08:00,494 --> 01:08:01,077
Lift!

595
01:08:01,870 --> 01:08:04,206
It's already past midnight.

596
01:08:04,331 --> 01:08:06,583
There's still a chance.

597
01:08:06,750 --> 01:08:08,543
Veil of Heaven, lift!

598
01:08:09,294 --> 01:08:11,505
What're you doing?
Out of my way!

599
01:08:11,630 --> 01:08:13,006
Time's up.

600
01:08:13,465 --> 01:08:16,593
It's over. Let it go.

601
01:08:29,564 --> 01:08:30,941
Celestial Master!

602
01:08:31,107 --> 01:08:35,362
I got the compass back,
so why can't I go home?

603
01:08:35,487 --> 01:08:40,575
If I was born a god,
I must already be enlightened!

604
01:08:41,284 --> 01:08:43,411
This piece-of-junk compass!

605
01:08:43,662 --> 01:08:46,289
I searched for it for 300 years!

606
01:08:47,874 --> 01:08:50,794
300 years! 300 years!

607
01:08:51,044 --> 01:08:54,130
This useless compass!

608
01:08:55,966 --> 01:08:57,300
Begone!

609
01:11:42,674 --> 01:11:45,135
Being "just a regular guy"
isn't so bad.

610
01:11:46,553 --> 01:11:50,390
Let's stop moping
and go with the flow.

611
01:11:50,515 --> 01:11:53,977
Hey, this year's fireworks
were awesome again!

612
01:11:55,353 --> 01:11:56,479
Phoenix Master!

613
01:11:56,646 --> 01:11:58,481
It's me, Gold Teeth!

614
01:11:58,815 --> 01:12:00,316
The richest guy in town!

615
01:12:00,483 --> 01:12:02,110
You've got the wrong guy.

616
01:12:02,235 --> 01:12:06,698
Don't play dumb.
You're Phoenix Master, right?

617
01:12:07,323 --> 01:12:10,660
Please stop. I'm not a god anymore.

618
01:12:10,827 --> 01:12:14,164
Did you really think
you were a god?

619
01:12:15,290 --> 01:12:17,042
What did you think I was?

620
01:12:17,500 --> 01:12:19,169
Our neighbor.

621
01:12:19,586 --> 01:12:22,130
The guy who puts on
the fireworks for us.

622
01:12:25,508 --> 01:12:28,845
Then this is a farewell toast.

623
01:12:29,971 --> 01:12:33,850
One drink, and I'll be on my way.

624
01:12:34,559 --> 01:12:38,646
We grew up
watching your fireworks.

625
01:12:39,022 --> 01:12:41,357
Who's gonna take over for you?

626
01:12:41,900 --> 01:12:45,528
Every year we work hard
just for the fireworks.

627
01:12:45,695 --> 01:12:48,698
They're the best part of New Year's.

628
01:12:48,865 --> 01:12:49,866
Open a shop!

629
01:12:49,991 --> 01:12:53,536
I'll pull out my back gold tooth
to fund it!

630
01:12:53,703 --> 01:12:56,039
It's not New Year's without you!

631
01:12:56,206 --> 01:12:58,208
"Friendly Neighbor Fireworks"!

632
01:12:58,333 --> 01:13:00,960
That's a great name!

633
01:13:01,086 --> 01:13:03,546
To Friendly Neighbor Fireworks!

634
01:13:08,301 --> 01:13:10,220
What great people.

635
01:14:15,743 --> 01:14:16,411
A demon!

636
01:14:16,536 --> 01:14:19,330
We're just regular folks now.

637
01:14:19,539 --> 01:14:20,957
Regular folks?

638
01:14:33,261 --> 01:14:36,848
Kneel, you worms!

639
01:14:46,608 --> 01:14:48,443
The temple's in danger! Let's go!

640
01:14:48,568 --> 01:14:49,986
Jade, wait!

641
01:14:50,778 --> 01:14:52,614
Don't do anything rash!

642
01:14:52,739 --> 01:14:53,823
Charge!

643
01:15:23,937 --> 01:15:27,565
Puny little gargoyles

644
01:15:27,690 --> 01:15:30,652
should just sit quietly on the roof.

645
01:15:30,777 --> 01:15:32,862
Playtime's over.

646
01:15:35,990 --> 01:15:37,158
What's that?

647
01:15:37,492 --> 01:15:38,409
Oh no!

648
01:15:40,370 --> 01:15:41,871
Mommy, look!

649
01:15:42,372 --> 01:15:44,540
Look at that kite!
It's the Cat God!

650
01:16:04,727 --> 01:16:05,895
They're back!

651
01:16:06,145 --> 01:16:07,438
They're working together!

652
01:16:07,563 --> 01:16:09,190
They're risking their lives to help?

653
01:16:38,511 --> 01:16:40,555
You pathetic maggots.

654
01:16:42,223 --> 01:16:45,560
Enjoy your last moments
as gargoyles.

655
01:16:49,981 --> 01:16:55,111
I'll wreck the whole temple,
roof and all!

656
01:17:06,039 --> 01:17:07,081
Master!

657
01:17:08,499 --> 01:17:09,792
Ow, hot!

658
01:17:10,293 --> 01:17:13,087
How's that? Want more?

659
01:17:20,345 --> 01:17:23,306
I've been lying to you
this whole time.

660
01:17:23,973 --> 01:17:25,475
I'm truly sorry.

661
01:17:26,893 --> 01:17:27,643
Feeny.

662
01:17:27,977 --> 01:17:31,981
It's time to make up
for 300 years of lies.

663
01:18:02,762 --> 01:18:07,350
Mega-Rat's reign
has finally come!

664
01:18:36,087 --> 01:18:41,884
I am the War God,
Phoenix Master!

665
01:18:44,554 --> 01:18:48,099
Master was a War God?

666
01:18:48,224 --> 01:18:49,392
So cool!

667
01:18:52,395 --> 01:18:56,232
A perfectly symmetrical face.
I haven't aged a day.

668
01:19:00,069 --> 01:19:01,070
Help!

669
01:19:01,863 --> 01:19:03,573
So it was you!

670
01:19:03,698 --> 01:19:05,575
Master, behind you!

671
01:19:25,219 --> 01:19:28,598
Master,
his weakness is light!

672
01:19:31,601 --> 01:19:33,769
I'll be taking that compass back.

673
01:19:45,323 --> 01:19:47,366
Give back the compass!

674
01:19:47,492 --> 01:19:49,619
In your dreams!

675
01:19:57,126 --> 01:19:58,628
Compass, spin!

676
01:20:01,506 --> 01:20:02,632
Feeny!

677
01:20:02,840 --> 01:20:04,800
Take that!

678
01:20:19,482 --> 01:20:20,399
The temple!

679
01:20:20,525 --> 01:20:21,817
That's our home!

680
01:20:26,197 --> 01:20:26,948
Let go!

681
01:20:28,741 --> 01:20:30,493
Don't move!

682
01:20:34,956 --> 01:20:39,502
Take one step closer,
and I'll smash your gargoyles!

683
01:20:39,669 --> 01:20:41,837
What do you want?

684
01:20:42,838 --> 01:20:45,049
Well, I'm the bad guy,

685
01:20:45,174 --> 01:20:48,678
so I'll make the most
evil demand ever.

686
01:20:48,844 --> 01:20:52,974
Do what I say,
and I'll spare the gargoyles.

687
01:20:53,808 --> 01:20:55,518
Don't listen to him!

688
01:20:55,810 --> 01:20:59,480
Quiet!
Not another word!

689
01:20:59,605 --> 01:21:00,481
Yikes!

690
01:21:05,778 --> 01:21:06,571
Name your terms.

691
01:21:08,698 --> 01:21:10,825
Good. Now kneel.

692
01:21:15,204 --> 01:21:16,372
Master!

693
01:21:16,539 --> 01:21:20,710
Crawl to the feet
of your one true ruler!

694
01:21:23,713 --> 01:21:26,215
I don't see you smiling.

695
01:21:26,382 --> 01:21:28,718
That's it, keep coming.

696
01:21:28,843 --> 01:21:29,719
Master!

697
01:21:32,680 --> 01:21:35,933
How's it feel to get crushed?

698
01:21:36,058 --> 01:21:38,728
Do you surrender? Answer me!

699
01:21:38,853 --> 01:21:40,605
Or I'll stomp you flat!

700
01:21:43,399 --> 01:21:46,027
Oops, I forgot. I'm immortal.

701
01:21:46,152 --> 01:21:47,236
My bad.

702
01:21:47,987 --> 01:21:49,405
Are you kidding me?

703
01:21:49,530 --> 01:21:52,241
Hang on, what's this?

704
01:21:52,742 --> 01:21:54,410
Celestial Master!

705
01:21:55,745 --> 01:21:56,746
Who?

706
01:21:57,955 --> 01:22:01,917
Lord of Heaven, answer me!

707
01:22:05,463 --> 01:22:07,048
He's finally lost it.

708
01:22:07,798 --> 01:22:09,425
Bottle Master.

709
01:22:09,884 --> 01:22:11,093
It's "Phoenix."

710
01:22:11,552 --> 01:22:13,054
That's what I said.

711
01:22:13,638 --> 01:22:16,599
More importantly,
are you ready for judgment?

712
01:22:17,933 --> 01:22:21,562
The compass has been returned.

713
01:22:22,229 --> 01:22:23,272
I see.

714
01:22:23,773 --> 01:22:25,107
Wait!

715
01:22:26,359 --> 01:22:30,112
Don't leave me behind!
I'm coming with you!

716
01:22:30,571 --> 01:22:34,950
Feeny, in my next life,
I want to be brothers again.

717
01:22:35,326 --> 01:22:36,786
Brothers forever.

718
01:22:40,873 --> 01:22:42,166
Feeny too?

719
01:22:46,837 --> 01:22:48,089
Too bright!

720
01:22:51,967 --> 01:22:53,969
That's some weak lightning.

721
01:22:54,095 --> 01:22:58,307
Is that all you've got?
Again!

722
01:23:04,814 --> 01:23:06,148
That tickles!

723
01:23:06,816 --> 01:23:09,527
No pain, no gain!

724
01:23:15,825 --> 01:23:17,576
New fireworks!

725
01:23:17,702 --> 01:23:19,704
Amazing! The Fireworks God!

726
01:23:21,080 --> 01:23:22,665
Awesome!

727
01:23:24,291 --> 01:23:26,752
Stupid light!
I can't see!

728
01:23:29,839 --> 01:23:31,006
Is it over?

729
01:23:31,132 --> 01:23:31,841
Master!

730
01:23:35,010 --> 01:23:36,178
Hurry, get over here!

731
01:23:37,722 --> 01:23:38,639
I can't move!

732
01:23:38,806 --> 01:23:41,183
No time! Take a deep breath!

733
01:23:49,942 --> 01:23:51,527
Again!

734
01:23:52,319 --> 01:23:55,531
Feels like a baby's kiss.

735
01:23:56,323 --> 01:23:57,199
Again!

736
01:23:59,910 --> 01:24:01,036
Not enough!

737
01:24:01,203 --> 01:24:03,330
I can't hold on!

738
01:24:03,456 --> 01:24:07,835
Celestial Master,
you're a total wimp!

739
01:24:10,087 --> 01:24:11,839
Somebody help me!

740
01:24:24,727 --> 01:24:25,519
Master!

741
01:24:26,729 --> 01:24:28,939
Still handsome.

742
01:24:32,151 --> 01:24:33,277
What?

743
01:24:34,737 --> 01:24:37,907
The rest is up to you guys.

744
01:24:41,869 --> 01:24:42,536
Light!

745
01:24:48,751 --> 01:24:53,255
You scum! I'm taking
you all down with me!

746
01:24:54,799 --> 01:24:57,802
If I go down, you're going too!

747
01:24:58,260 --> 01:24:59,845
Let them go!

748
01:25:01,764 --> 01:25:03,599
You traitor!

749
01:25:06,101 --> 01:25:07,436
You're not getting away!

750
01:25:13,275 --> 01:25:14,610
Let go!

751
01:25:14,777 --> 01:25:18,739
Everyone, now!
Reflect the light!

752
01:25:18,864 --> 01:25:20,115
Reflect it!

753
01:25:22,368 --> 01:25:23,786
Reflect the light!

754
01:25:24,119 --> 01:25:25,454
Reflect it!

755
01:25:25,621 --> 01:25:26,914
How's this?

756
01:25:36,632 --> 01:25:38,133
Aim for his eyes!

757
01:25:38,259 --> 01:25:40,469
Let's focus the light!

758
01:25:42,263 --> 01:25:44,932
There! Use the temple tower!

759
01:25:45,140 --> 01:25:46,684
It'll get wrecked!

760
01:25:47,226 --> 01:25:48,894
There's no other way!

761
01:25:49,103 --> 01:25:50,646
More power!

762
01:26:01,949 --> 01:26:04,493
Everyone, aim over there!

763
01:26:05,661 --> 01:26:07,162
Aim for the temple!

764
01:26:07,872 --> 01:26:09,248
Toward the temple!

765
01:26:09,415 --> 01:26:10,332
Light up the temple!

766
01:26:18,340 --> 01:26:20,509
Pry his eyes open!

767
01:26:42,823 --> 01:26:46,076
I was right about you,
little guy.

768
01:26:50,915 --> 01:26:51,874
Well done!

769
01:27:00,883 --> 01:27:03,385
My power's fading!

770
01:27:03,552 --> 01:27:06,847
The compass's power...

771
01:27:13,062 --> 01:27:16,065
Finally got the compass back.

772
01:27:34,917 --> 01:27:35,960
We won!

773
01:27:36,085 --> 01:27:37,294
We're saved!

774
01:28:01,819 --> 01:28:03,278
What are you gonna do?

775
01:28:07,449 --> 01:28:09,994
Impressive work. I won't break it.

776
01:28:10,119 --> 01:28:11,912
Where'd you get the idea?

777
01:28:13,122 --> 01:28:14,123
What?

778
01:28:16,166 --> 01:28:19,044
This. Here, take it.

779
01:28:22,172 --> 01:28:23,799
Smart kid.

780
01:28:26,343 --> 01:28:29,138
Fireworks God... I mean,
Phoenix Master!

781
01:28:29,263 --> 01:28:31,140
The War God!

782
01:28:33,642 --> 01:28:34,643
Master!

783
01:28:38,272 --> 01:28:39,606
Aw, you're making me blush.

784
01:28:40,983 --> 01:28:44,778
Phoenix Master, you've
finally reached enlightenment.

785
01:28:44,903 --> 01:28:49,658
Return to Heaven.
I'll restore your old rank.

786
01:28:49,825 --> 01:28:52,161
You're leaving?

787
01:28:52,327 --> 01:28:55,122
Celestial Master,
please wait a moment.

788
01:28:56,415 --> 01:29:00,502
You guys,
take care of Jade and Gold City.

789
01:29:01,211 --> 01:29:03,130
On second thought...

790
01:29:04,089 --> 01:29:05,674
I wasn't finished!

791
01:29:07,092 --> 01:29:08,635
He's gone.

792
01:29:08,844 --> 01:29:11,847
He just flashed and vanished.

793
01:29:11,972 --> 01:29:16,351
Now I don't even remember
what I was gonna say.

794
01:29:17,352 --> 01:29:19,521
Xander, did you gain weight?

795
01:29:26,862 --> 01:29:30,491
For 300 years, I've been
lying to you, Celestial Master.

796
01:29:30,616 --> 01:29:32,576
Let me speak from the heart.

797
01:29:33,035 --> 01:29:34,870
Go on.

798
01:29:35,037 --> 01:29:38,040
I've decided to go back
to the mortal world.

799
01:29:38,207 --> 01:29:43,378
Gold City is where
I'm meant to do my duty.

800
01:29:52,137 --> 01:29:53,347
Very well.

801
01:29:54,264 --> 01:29:57,392
Heaven's nice,
but I missed everyone.

802
01:29:57,684 --> 01:29:59,394
Master!

803
01:30:05,901 --> 01:30:08,779
Gifts from Master!

804
01:30:08,904 --> 01:30:09,905
What's this?

805
01:30:10,280 --> 01:30:13,575
"Sonny, even when I'm gone,
never forget"

806
01:30:14,076 --> 01:30:16,245
"you're a dragon prince."

807
01:30:16,370 --> 01:30:18,872
"Believe in yourself."

808
01:30:21,416 --> 01:30:25,129
"Xander, you're
an honest soul."

809
01:30:25,254 --> 01:30:27,548
"But you've got a short fuse."

810
01:30:27,673 --> 01:30:32,094
"Think before you speak,
and life will be better."

811
01:30:33,262 --> 01:30:34,388
Maybe so.

812
01:30:34,972 --> 01:30:36,431
One for Jade too.

813
01:30:37,599 --> 01:30:41,812
"Your strength is
being true to yourself."

814
01:30:42,396 --> 01:30:46,108
"Even back in Heaven,
I'll keep learning from you."

815
01:30:46,316 --> 01:30:49,444
"Let's always make
each other proud."

816
01:30:54,616 --> 01:30:56,952
Looks like we're
in the same line of work.

817
01:30:57,327 --> 01:31:00,622
Keeping everyone safe
is an important job.

818
01:31:05,460 --> 01:31:10,174
Keeping people safe?
That's a security guard's job.

819
01:31:10,299 --> 01:31:14,094
Let's get the compass back
and live it up as gods!

820
01:31:23,687 --> 01:31:25,147
One for Ten-Ten too.

821
01:31:25,272 --> 01:31:28,609
"Ten-Ten, you move so fast"

822
01:31:28,734 --> 01:31:31,028
"that you tend to forget
what you set out to do."

823
01:31:31,153 --> 01:31:34,156
"Don't lose sight of yourself."

824
01:31:34,281 --> 01:31:38,285
Where's Ten-Ten?
Did you see him up there?

825
01:31:38,410 --> 01:31:39,745
Did he kick the bucket?

826
01:31:39,870 --> 01:31:43,207
He went to get help
and never came back.

827
01:31:43,332 --> 01:31:48,003
Didn't see him.
Maybe he got lost.

828
01:31:50,672 --> 01:31:51,924
The compass!

829
01:32:05,229 --> 01:32:07,689
Thanks for guiding me
to enlightenment.

830
01:32:07,856 --> 01:32:10,692
Watch over the compass
and see where it goes.

831
01:32:11,735 --> 01:32:14,029
Master!

832
01:32:14,947 --> 01:32:15,614
Ten-Ten!

833
01:32:15,739 --> 01:32:18,825
Heaven's a weird place.
They made me wear this hat...

834
01:32:19,117 --> 01:32:19,868
Welcome back!

835
01:32:19,993 --> 01:32:21,495
And it was dirty.

836
01:32:21,620 --> 01:32:23,163
Is that a cat?

837
01:32:23,914 --> 01:32:25,499
Where's the demon?

838
01:32:25,624 --> 01:32:27,376
Take care!

839
01:32:27,542 --> 01:32:28,585
Have a good trip!

840
01:32:28,710 --> 01:32:30,170
Not even a goodbye?

841
01:32:31,713 --> 01:32:33,382
Come back in spring!

842
01:32:39,554 --> 01:32:41,348
Okay, go on home.

843
01:32:42,432 --> 01:32:44,017
Take care.

844
01:34:17,069 --> 01:34:20,113
This is real life
Not Tom and Jerry

845
01:34:20,238 --> 01:34:22,824
Childhood dreams still keep me going

846
01:34:22,991 --> 01:34:25,660
Storms can't make me fall behind

847
01:34:25,827 --> 01:34:27,996
Chasing dreams, taking off on time

848
01:34:28,413 --> 01:34:30,832
I'll grab the future I'm aiming for

849
01:34:30,999 --> 01:34:33,168
Never give up, that's the rule

850
01:34:33,293 --> 01:34:35,796
Her image floating in my mind

851
01:34:35,921 --> 01:34:38,382
My cure when I'm feeling down

852
01:34:38,507 --> 01:34:41,176
I guard it close like cheese

853
01:34:41,301 --> 01:34:43,553
Flying high, safe when we're together

854
01:34:43,678 --> 01:34:46,348
Off on an adventure, treasure in a cave

855
01:34:46,515 --> 01:34:48,725
The enemy's moves are just a bluff

856
01:34:48,850 --> 01:34:53,688
Tom's in love, his rap's the talk of town
In his heart, a compass

857
01:34:53,814 --> 01:34:56,858
With her, every night's the Moon Festival

858
01:34:57,025 --> 01:34:59,027
On a moon-viewing boat,
feeling like a heartthrob

859
01:34:59,152 --> 01:35:01,571
Through the rain and through the wind

860
01:35:01,696 --> 01:35:04,282
Let's head back to our hometown

861
01:35:04,408 --> 01:35:06,785
Turn on the TV
and it's Tom and Jerry

862
01:35:06,910 --> 01:35:09,371
Mess up? Keep on smiling

863
01:35:09,538 --> 01:35:11,915
Sun's going down,
five minutes till school's out

864
01:35:12,040 --> 01:35:14,668
Jump on Dad's bike
and GO

865
01:35:14,793 --> 01:35:17,212
Turn on the TV
and it's Tom and Jerry

866
01:35:17,379 --> 01:35:20,382
Tomorrow's gonna be better
so smile

867
01:35:30,183 --> 01:35:32,561
{\an8}Landed in the East, dragons in flight

868
01:35:32,686 --> 01:35:35,105
{\an8}My world, you don't
have to get it

869
01:35:35,230 --> 01:35:37,774
{\an8}I swallow the pain
Don't need comfort

870
01:35:37,899 --> 01:35:40,360
{\an8}Not just any cat
Don't need flattery

871
01:35:40,485 --> 01:35:43,196
{\an8}Check out my merch

872
01:35:43,321 --> 01:35:45,740
{\an8}My crew's all geniuses

873
01:35:45,866 --> 01:35:48,326
{\an8}Wanna live every day
in a suite

874
01:35:48,452 --> 01:35:50,745
{\an8}Live every day to the fullest, god life

875
01:35:50,912 --> 01:35:53,790
{\an8}When I felt lost,
I learned from her

876
01:35:53,915 --> 01:35:56,460
{\an8}My life is mine
to decide

877
01:35:56,585 --> 01:35:58,962
{\an8}Fight the darkness
Friendship won't break

878
01:35:59,087 --> 01:36:01,548
{\an8}I'm the star, not a sidekick

879
01:36:01,673 --> 01:36:04,092
{\an8}"Unity is stronger than gold"

880
01:36:04,259 --> 01:36:06,678
{\an8}Joy and pain,
let's share them

881
01:36:06,803 --> 01:36:09,264
{\an8}In a flash it changes
from 2D to 3D

882
01:36:09,431 --> 01:36:12,184
{\an8}Thanks to my dream team
we made it

883
01:36:12,309 --> 01:36:14,644
{\an8}Through the rain and through the wind

884
01:36:14,769 --> 01:36:17,439
{\an8}Let's head back to our hometown

885
